{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00932","headline":"横吹曲辞 出塞 · 王维","name":"横吹曲辞 出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"居延城外猎天骄，白草连天野火烧。\n暮云空碛时驱马，秋日平原好射鵰。\n护羌校尉朝乘障，破虏将军夜渡辽。\n玉靶角弓珠勒马，汉家将赐霍嫖姚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}